---
import BaseLayout  from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const name = "Privacy";
const description = "Privacy";
---

<BaseLayout 
	pageTitle={name}
	description={description}
>
	<div>
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Interwar.org is an independent historical archive committed to respecting visitors’ privacy.

We do not use advertising, tracking cookies, or third-party advertising trackers. We do not require user accounts or intentionally collect personal information from visitors. We do not sell personal information or use it for targeted advertising.

We aim to keep the website simple, collect as little information as possible, and provide a browsing experience free from advertising and unnecessary tracking.
</p>
	</div>

</BaseLayout>